@startuml
'==== Title ====
title "As a Buyer, I want to use the Web UI to bid on an auction." - SD

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox
autonumber

' ==== Actor and participants ====
actor Buyer as User
participant ":Mitelovers" as System

User -> System : I would like to know %n() what I can do in %n() regard to an existing %n()auction
activate System
System --> User : display HATEOAS links
deactivate System


User -> System : I want to place a %n() bid on this auction
activate System
System --> User: Sucess!
deactivate System

@enduml